      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "批索引确认默认禁用，需要在 broker 侧设置 acknowledgmentAtBatchIndexLevelEnabled=true，并在 consumer 侧调用 enableBatchIndexAcknowledgment(true)，启用后还会带来更高内存开销。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "pulsar",
